## 📂 Project Structure

This project is built with **React** and **Vite**, utilizing a component-driven architecture for scalability and clean code management.

```text
src/
├── assets/                  # Static assets like images and icons
│   ├── Resources/           # Dynamic media assets (Backgrounds, Profile pics)
│   ├── hero.png             # Homepage banner graphic
│   ├── react.svg
│   └── vite.svg
├── components/              # Reusable functional UI components
│   ├── ProfileEdits/        # Sub-components specific to editing profiles
│   │   ├── FeatureEdits.jsx
│   │   └── Header.jsx
│   ├── About.jsx            # About section layout
│   ├── Avatar.jsx           # Profile picture handler
│   ├── Contact.jsx          # Contact information block
│   ├── Edit-icon.jsx        # SVG/Icon components
│   ├── Feature.jsx          # Highlights/Featured elements
│   ├── Location.jsx         # Map or address container
│   ├── Post.jsx             # Feed or social posts
│   └── SaveContact.jsx      # Form button/handler to submit contact data
├── Pages/                   # Main structural viewports / Route pages
│   ├── Profile.css          # Styling for the Profile viewport
│   ├── Profile.jsx          # Main Profile page view
│   ├── ProfileEdits.css     # Styling for the Edit layout view
│   └── ProfileEdits.jsx     # The Profile Editor dashboard view
├── App.css                  # Global application styles
├── App.jsx                  # Main application entry component and routing layout
└── main.jsx                 # Vite standard DOM injection layer